    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to be a dinosaur with a gun?<br><br>Grab a beer and enjoy a boss battler experience that will make you say &quot;Hell Yeah&quot;! Includes dinosaurs with guns in adorable low poly graphics!<br><br>Drink beer, upgrade your gear and shoot some dinosaurs! Read your opponents, predict their moves and watch out for flying barrels! Good luck soldier!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353170/extras/544d0e7b7258151fbf212373138052f5.poster.avif?t=1746117319\" width=507 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353170/extras/544d0e7b7258151fbf212373138052f5.webm?t=1746117319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from a variety of weapons, dodge vicious attacks and be the last dino standing. May your roar be the last!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353170/extras/545b965f6c0848a841c5590b07621fee.poster.avif?t=1746117319\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353170/extras/545b965f6c0848a841c5590b07621fee.webm?t=1746117319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
